  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Guts Gu strengthens a person’s soul. Fang Yuan uses it both to heal soul injuries and to raise soul foundation beyond recovery alone. The soul cannot be strengthened without limit this way. If the soul is not concentrated enough, large numbers of guts Gu can over-inflate it and cause a certain-death disaster.",
        "chapters": [
          410
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later on the same mountain he raises his soul to a hundred times a normal person’s, called hundred man soul, and stops there because one more use would destroy the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          422
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Rockmen who obtain gutstones can use guts Gu to expand their souls until the overflow forms new little rockmen.",
        "chapters": [
          413
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "race_rockmen"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When the Gu is used from storage, airsac Gu are crushed and the guts Gu inside break, turning into nourishment that strengthens and recovers the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          822
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_airsac_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the aperture the same Gu shatter into a mysterious power that acts on the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          1092
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The text later calls guts Gu the most perfect nutrient for the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          1792
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
